# Export from dev by loading a saved list instead of selecting by hand. Needs the newest .txt in the settings
# folder's lists\ to be a list like tests\ui-scenarios\load-list.txt (copy it there first).
Enter                 # main menu: Export
Enter                 # dev
wait:what to export
Down                  # Load a list
Enter
wait:list picker
Enter                 # newest list
wait:loaded (with what was not applied)
Enter                 # pause -> summary
wait:summary from the list
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # Back (Check, Mapping, Save, Export, Import, Back, Menu)
Enter
wait:selection browser with the list's marks
F2
wait:summary again
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # Menu
Enter
text:y
Enter
Down
Down
Down
Enter                 # Quit
